    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis syndon ða gerihta ðe se cyning ah ofer ealle men on Wessexan, þæt is mundbryce ⁊ hamsocne, forstal ⁊ fyrdwite, buton hwǽne he furðor gemæðian wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the dues to which the king is entitled from all men in Wessex, namely, [the payments for] violation of his mund, and for attacks on people's houses, for assault and for neglecting military service, unless he desires to show especial honour to anyone [by granting him these dues].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðis syndon þa gerihta, þe se cingc ah ofer ealle men on Wessexan: þæt is mundbryce ⁊ hamsocne, forsteal ⁊ flymena fyrmðe ⁊ fyrdwite, butan he hwæne ðe furðor gemæðrian wylle (⁊ he him ðæs weorðscipes geunne).</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
